<title>SOUTH AFRICA: MASTERFRIDGE LIFTS INTERIM SHR, DIV.</title>
<headline>MASTERFRIDGE LIFTS INTERIM SHR, DIV.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>Shr (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		    16.56     vs    9.90</p>
<p>    - diluted		   16.49     vs    9.90  </p>
<p>    Attrib income	     13.81     vs    5.68</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     17.50     vs    7.09</p>
<p>    Tax			    2.97     vs    1.32</p>
<p>    Interest paid		0.93     vs    4.02</p>
<p>    Turnover		   197.94     vs    130.82</p>
<p>    Share of associates'     0.72     vs    0.09</p>
<p>Full name: Masterfridge Ltd (electronics and electrical)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said given projected growth in the white</p>
<p>goods industry of around 15 percent in the current year, it was</p>
<p>confident of retaining market share. Earnings for the second</p>
<p>half of the fiscal year were expected to approximate interim</p>
<p>results, on an increased number of shares in issue.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
